source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: A following word rune suppresses the token, so the emoticon escape consumes nothing and the backslash stays visible.
-- input.jira --
a\:)b
-- rendered.html --
<p>a\:)b</p>
-- want.md --
a\\:)b
